WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.146
Week 18: Irregular Preterite and Meaning Change. report discoveries and attempts distinguish intention from outcome summarize a trip

2
00:00:09.146 --> 00:00:15.967
Mission brief. Explain a failed plan, the unexpected discovery, and the final resolution.

3
00:00:15.967 --> 00:00:25.649
Preparation. Select ten useful words, three linking expressions, and two repair phrases. Plan points rather than a memorized paragraph.

4
00:00:25.649 --> 00:00:33.792
Performance. Complete the task once for fluency, review the evidence, then repeat it for greater clarity and accuracy.

5
00:00:33.792 --> 00:00:42.575
After-action review. Record what succeeded, what blocked communication, and the single change that will matter most on the next attempt.

6
00:00:42.575 --> 00:01:10.924
Model language. Voy a explicar un plan fallido. — I am going to explain a failed plan. Describo el descubrimiento inesperado. — I describe the unexpected discovery. Al final, la situación se resolvió bien. — In the end, the situation resolved well. No logramos todo lo planeado. — We didn't achieve everything planned. La resolución final fue positiva. — The final resolution was positive.

7
00:01:10.924 --> 00:01:20.929
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
